# Copy to .env.local (not committed) and fill in.
# Google OAuth Client ID for "Continue with Google" on Registration.
# Google Cloud Console > APIs & Services > Credentials > Create credentials > OAuth client ID (Web application).
# Authorized JavaScript origins: http://localhost:5173 (and your real site address later).
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=

# Connect to the MSMA HRIS backend (github.com/adymsma-works/MSMA-HRIS-backend). Leave empty to run on
# the in-browser data. "/api" goes through the dev server to the backend on port 4000.
# VITE_API_URL=/api
# Where the backend runs, if not http://127.0.0.1:4000:
# HEYHR_API_TARGET=http://127.0.0.1:4000
